			<h5 style="text-align:center;">It's Not all work when you join the Women’s Auxiliary!</h5>
			<p style="text-align:center;">Make new friends, enjoy meaningful fellowship, and have fun together. Best of all, you’ll make a difference in your community along the way.</p>
